<title>USA: Eagle Finance sells $12.1 mln auto loans.</title>
<headline>Eagle Finance sells $12.1 mln auto loans.</headline>
<dateline>GURNEE, Ill. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eagle Finance Corp said Monday it sold $12.1 million in gross receivables to Search Capital Group Inc for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>The loan sale reflects Eagle's de-emphasis of its Texas operations.</p>
<p>Eagle finances the purchase of late-model used cars for consumers who have limited access to traditional sources of credit.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
